{"version":1,"content":"<p>倪晨曦（Elva）的網上節目《晨曦圓夢系列》日前播出第5集，請來好友陳柏宇攜手，為25歲的黃綽思實現多年心願，讓她首次踏足紅館欣賞偶像演唱會，並於演出後到後台見面，留下珍貴回憶。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:38:12.616929+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":89,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T07:03:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T05:59:43.705597+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T07:38:12.616929+00:00","content_hash":"2b107cbeb5163884e80a25c34f3747b7261e1332fae889a924b0f28cd3bd86ee","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}